Use case: stylized-concept. Production transparent sprite sheet for the Japanese anime shooting game Refrain. The reference is the current playable character: PRESERVE face, hairstyle, hair color, eye color, chibi body proportions, gentle expression, polished cel-shaded linework and shading. Change ONLY clothing and accessories to the described new costume. This is one 3-column by 4-row sprite sheet, portrait 1536x2048 pixels or larger at exactly 3:4 canvas aspect. Exactly equal rectangular cells, 12 cells. Each figure is a FULL BODY isolated sprite centered in its own cell; shoes, hair, hands never clipped. Consistent head size and body scale between every pose. Each figure occupies 80% of cell height, transparent margin on all sides. No cell borders or text. Real transparent RGBA background, not a checkerboard. No backdrop, effects or shadows outside the figures.
Cells left to right, top to bottom:
0 normal gameplay pose, three-quarter view facing right with a light floating bent-leg posture;
1 aiming straight up, body remains upright, hands reaching upward;
2 aiming upper-right at 45 degrees, body remains upright;
3 aiming horizontally right, body upright;
4 aiming lower-right at 45 degrees, body upright;
5 aiming downward, body upright;
6 dodge spinning upright FRONT VIEW;
7 dodge spinning upright right THREE-QUARTER FRONT VIEW;
8 dodge spinning upright RIGHT PROFILE;
9 dodge spinning upright right THREE-QUARTER BACK VIEW;
10 dodge spinning upright FULL BACK VIEW;
11 empty transparent cell.
The last five are turntable frames of one upright pose, not somersaults or tilted cards. Match the same costume details on front and back across all 11 sprites. No copies of the original outfit, no labels, no letters, no watermark, no detached body parts.
REI new costume 'Encore Stream': keep her VTUBER avatar identity with long deep-indigo hair, vivid purple eyes, pink-and-gold hair tips, one small gold star hair clip. Entirely new futuristic pop-performer outfit: cropped WHITE asymmetrical jacket with black cuffs and cyan inner panels, a black high-neck top, short black tailored shorts, one short white waist cape at the back, a small gold-star belt buckle, cyan-trimmed black ankle boots and asymmetric black-and-white knee socks. A vivid magenta neck ribbon is the accent. Modest outfit, no midriff, no cleavage. NOT her original white purple magical-girl skirt. The avatar has a compact gold-star wand in the aiming hand, pointing in the specified directions; keep it close to torso during all five upright spin angles. Extra transparent cell margins.
